          label: qsTranslate("SetPageAppearance", "Paint in controls"),
          sub: qsTranslate("SetPageAppearance", "Toggles, switches and buttons can carry the same living paint the Line does. It is the same solver and the same colours, just a lot smaller. Big controls hold the picture well; a narrow switch track cannot fit a filament with dark either side of it, so if the small ones read as a smudge, this is the switch that turns them off.") },
